            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Is there an AI bubble? BlackRock, BofA don't seem to think so",
            "description": "<p>Wall Street has gone back and forth over whether the market (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) is in an AI bubble or not. BlackRock and Bank of America apparently have the answer: we're not in a bubble.</p>\n<p>Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> is joined by Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Allie Canal</a> to examine new AI outlooks from the two top Wall Street firms, including their consensus on the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/k-shaped-economy-masking-weakness-120055279.html\">K-shaped economy.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Wall Street has gone back and forth over whether the market (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC) is in an AI bubble or not. BlackRock and Bank of America apparently have the answer: we're not in a bubble. Market Domination host Josh Lipton is joined by Yahoo Finance senior reporter Allie Canal to examine new AI outlooks from the two top Wall Street firms, including their consensus on the K-shaped economy. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
