        {
          "id": "f4df828f-e456-3000-9176-eaf92212c867",
          "content": {
            "id": "f4df828f-e456-3000-9176-eaf92212c867",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Bitcoin rebounds, ETFs take hit, BofA recommends crypto: 3 Things",
            "description": "<p>US stock futures (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ES%3DF\">ES=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NQ%3DF\">NQ=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/YM%3DF\">YM=F</a>) are rising in Tuesday's pre-market trading as bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) bounces back above $87,000 per token.</p>\n<p>As bitcoin's recent volatility has dragged crypto stocks lower, particularly hitting Strategy's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSTR\">MSTR</a>) ETFs in 2025.</p>\n<p>Bank of America (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>) is recommending that its wealth management clients<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/bank-of-america-says-its-wealth-management-clients-may-put-up-to-4-of-their-portfolio-in-crypto-220028738.html\"> should have 4% of their portfolio</a> allocated into crypto.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "US stock futures (ES=F, NQ=F, YM=F) are rising in Tuesday's pre-market trading as bitcoin (BTC-USD) bounces back above $87,000 per token. As bitcoin's recent volatility has dragged crypto stocks lower, particularly hitting Strategy's (MSTR) ETFs in 2025. Bank of America (BAC) is recommending that its wealth management clients should have 4% of their portfolio allocated into crypto. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Morning Brief.",
